  },"decision": {"summary":"Two of three condition nodes lack full evidentiary support. Node node-1md6ssy asserts a negative about briefing content that cannot be verified from the partial excerpt; we need either the full briefing text or confirmation that such detail is unnecessary for this task type. Node node-1ji7zuu infers an investigation requirement not explicitly stated in the provided rules; deferral alone does not prove an investigative process was mandated, only that work paused and records retained.",
